          "value": "Revenue by region"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 1,
      "position": [
        46,
        65
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "position": [
            67,
            140
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A pipeline is an ordered list and the order is the whole of the meaning:\n"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            140,
            148
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "filter"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            148,
            167
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " drops rows before "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            167,
            175
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "derive"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            175,
            205
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " computes anything from them, "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            205,
            213
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "derive"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            213,
            235
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " adds\nthe column that "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            235,
            246
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "aggregate"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            246,
            268
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " then folds away, and "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            268,
            274
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "sort"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            274,
            279
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " and "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            279,
            286
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "limit"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            286,
            339
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " run last —\non the grouped rows, not on the raw ones."
        }
      ],
      "position": [
        67,
        339
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "position": [
            341,
            406
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Every step here is load-bearing. The zero-unit row is dropped by "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            406,
            414
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "filter"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            414,
            451
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "\nbefore it can pull an average down, "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            451,
            460
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "revenue"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            460,
            586
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " does not exist in the data\nsection at all, the four regions arrive in first-appearance order and leave in\nrevenue order, and "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            586,
            593
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "limit"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            593,
            653
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " cuts the smallest of them rather than the last one\nwritten."
        }
      ],
      "position": [
        341,
        653
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
